# Infra

- Local deps: `./start-dev-services.sh` (or `make up`) — app on host via `devserver`.
- Bind mounts live under `./volumes/<service>/` (postgres, redis, rabbitmq, …); data is gitignored via `.gitkeep` placeholders.
- Prod: `docker-compose.yml` + entrypoints under `docker/`.
- New/changed env → update `.env.example` and document production defaults.
- Broker/cache/DB/port/volume/healthcheck changes → developer alert section required (see `core` rule).
{%- if cookiecutter.use_rabbitmq == "y" %}
- RabbitMQ 4+: keep `docker/rabbitmq/rabbitmq.conf` (`transient_nonexcl_queues` permit) — Celery needs it.
{%- endif %}
{%- if cookiecutter.use_celery == "y" %}
- Celery worker/beat: compose services + `scripts/run_celery_*.sh` / entrypoints.
{%- endif %}
{%- if cookiecutter.reverse_proxy == "nginx" %}
- Reverse proxy: Nginx (`docker/nginx/`).
{%- elif cookiecutter.reverse_proxy == "traefik" %}
- Reverse proxy: Traefik (`docker/traefik/`).
{%- endif %}

